# Unity imports of dotnet build folders
src/**/bin.meta
src/**/obj.meta
src/**/*.csproj.meta

# The Sim is a local Unity package (unity/Packages/manifest.json `file:`), so every import writes a meta beside each
# source. Nothing references a Sim script by guid (the Sim has noEngineReferences; assemblies link it by name), so
# script metas stay local; the package-level metas (package.json, the asmdef, csc.rsp, BannedSymbols.txt) are tracked.
# Rule and checks: tools/tests/test_asset_metas.py (#1217).
src/GrandSluggers.Sim/**/*.cs.meta

# Python delivery tooling
__pycache__/

# Generated output: stills, takes, validation dumps. Evidence goes on the PR.
scratchpad/
